{"data":[{"author_id":"1807278717695315968","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:49:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111726269088117108"],"id":"2111726269088117108","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":460,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"说个暴论，\n\n现在中国三年的出生人口，\n\n仅相当于文革时一年的出生人口，\n\n现在一年的出生人口，\n\n已远低于1961年大饥荒。","url":"https://x.com/Cuichenghao777/status/2111726269088117108"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112202278799081472","3_2112202278769754112"]},"author_id":"1811888010088316932","created_at":"2026-10-19T15:20:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112202291558424842"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SpwP8iD79f","end":168,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cuichenghao/status/2112202291558424842/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112202278799081472","start":145,"url":"https://t.co/SpwP8iD79f"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SpwP8iD79f","end":168,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cuichenghao/status/2112202291558424842/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112202278769754112","start":145,"url":"https://t.co/SpwP8iD79f"}]},"id":"2112202291558424842","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":7966,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":6},"text":"这两张图放在一起，看着有点后背发凉。\n\n2016年，内地出生人口1786万，养老金涨幅6.5%。到了2025年，出生人口792万，养老金涨幅只剩2%。\n\n越来越明显的是，领养老金的人越来越多，未来缴费的人却越来越少。\n\n如今，内地年轻人连工作、结婚、生孩子都发愁，养老的账，让他们怎么扛？ https://t.co/SpwP8iD79f","url":"https://x.com/cuichenghao/status/2112202291558424842"},{"article":{"title":"中国出生人口20年腰斩：从1786万到792万，正在重塑学校"},"author_id":"1629471898399813632","created_at":"2026-10-18T13:35:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111813338850296121"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2111…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111809352055279616","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111809352055279616","url":"https://t.co/2MpvHzJI2A"}]},"id":"2111813338850296121","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30,"like_count":1,"q